<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,251 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 126.91 pence a kilo against 128.00 last week and 112.39 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 41,762 pkgs sold so far this year is 117.72 pence against 114.35 pence for the 51,606 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
